Variant of render_short_4k_compositor.py (9:16, frozen history) for the 4:5
format ordered by Matthieu: 3072x3840 at 60 fps, 30.00 s exact. Same canon:
Sectra Bold Italic white title with black stroke and NO capsule, two-line
subtitles in line-by-line canon (line 2 at +0.67 s), punch curve, vivid
